SUMMARY:Sound Bath & Gong Meditation w David Heiss
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\nJoin in for a relaxing sound bath medit
 ation led by David Heiss\, Long time gong player and sound healing musicia
 n. David has been playing gongs and facilitating sound healing journeys si
 nce 2012.\n\nLeave the week's stress behind as you relax and reset your ne
 rvous system with this special clearing crystal gong bath.\n**We will begi
 n with a brief overview of the current astrology in the sky\,** Then enjoy
  a powerful yet relaxing 45 min. gong meditation followed by an integratio
 n.\n\nWhen the gong sings\, you listen. You listen listens with every cell
  of your body. You hear it and feel it. You begin to sense more. The obscu
 re sounds leave your brain guessing and eventually surrenders to the sound
 wave as you begin to relax\, feel and heal. The vibrational frequencies ca
 n awaken stagnant energy. The experience is like a personal dream. There a
 re moments during a gong meditation where the subconscious can become more
  conscious\, where illumination and insight follows.\n\nSuggested donation
 s for this event are $20-40. Donations can be made at the event via cash o
 r Venmo **@starsounds**\nIf you like to donate early reserving your spot\,
  you can right here using Venmo **@starsounds** here but not required.\nWa
 lk-ins are welcome as a 1st arrive basis\, cash at the door is fine. There
  is plenty of room\, sometimes it will max out. If you want your spot guar
 anteed\, come about 15 min early **or** pre-pay Venmo **@starsounds**\n**Y
 ou can RSVP here or at** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-d
 etails/sound-bath-gong-meditation-w-david-heiss)\n\nWe provide some pads a
 nd blankets. You are welcome to bring your own comfort items. You are also
  able to sit in our chairs if you prefer that support.\n\nThe entrance is 
 located at the very center of the shopping center in Woodfin. \\* downstai
 rs \\*\n\n* The event is from 6:00 pm to 7:30 pm\n\n**About David**\nDavid
  Heiss specializes in Self-Discovery using sound alchemy though blending u
 nique sounds with instruments including many gongs\, crystal bowls\, and o
 ther abstract sounding pieces that create a abstract symphony of sound ove
 rtones to create a healing restorative experience. Being an Evolutionary A
 strologer\, he offers natal chart readings to assist in your self-discover
 y process as he has personal experience in the success of these divine art
 s in his own healing process. He has been working with stars and sounds\, 
 AKA Gongs and Astrology since 2012. His intention is to create a space thr
 ough sound to help you realize more of who you are.\n*\n\n```\nDavid disco
 vered the healing vibration of Gongs in 2012 after a powerful spontaneous 
 Kundalini Awakening and has ever since been drawn to Self-Discovery by Kno
 wing Thy-Self. Convinced that the stars are inside of us\, he uses sound a
 nd evolutionary astrology to discover who we are and why we are here findi
 ng our souls purpose on earth. Since 2015\, David has dedicated his life t
 o Self-Discovery using astrology and sound alchemy though blending unique 
 sounds with instruments including many gongs\, crystal bowls\, and other a
 bstract sounding pieces creating a abstract symphony of sound overtones to
  create a healing restorative experience.\n```
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-mountain-star-sounds/events
 /316271471/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260825T192753Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260825T192753Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
