X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315656887/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_315656887@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041406Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260907T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260907T193000
SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads - Book Club
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**September 2026 Selection - *To Have and 
 Have Not* by Ernest Hemingway**\n[Amazon](https://www.amazon.com/Have-Not-
 Scribner-Classics/dp/0684859238/) - [GoodReads](https://www.goodreads.com/
 book/show/4630.To_Have_and_Have_Not)\n\n*To Have and Have Not is the drama
 tic story of Harry Morgan\, an honest man who is forced into running contr
 aband between Cuba and Key West as a means of keeping his crumbling family
  financially afloat. His adventures lead him into the world of the wealthy
  and dissipated yachtsmen who throng the region and involve him in a stran
 ge and unlikely love affair.*\n\n*In this harshly realistic\, yet oddly te
 nder and wise novel\, Hemingway perceptively delineates the personal strug
 gles of both the "haves" and the "have nots" and creates one of the most s
 ubtle and moving portraits of a love affair in his oeuvre. By turns funny 
 and tragic\, lively and poetic\, remarkable in its emotional impact\, To H
 ave and Have Not is literary high adventure at its finest.*\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\n\n**Welcome to our monthly Book Club!** We’re a small\, friendly grou
 p that gets together for fun\, thoughtful conversations about a different 
 book each month.\n\nFinished the whole book? Great. Only made it through a
  few chapters? Still come. Didn’t read it at all but the discussion soun
 ds interesting? Honestly\, you’re welcome too.\nWe meet on the **first T
 uesday of every month**.\n\nOne of the best things about this group is tha
 t we keep it relatively small and guide the conversation\, so it doesn’t
  turn into three people talking while everyone else quietly questions thei
 r life choices. Everyone has a chance to jump in\, share their thoughts\, 
 and explore the book’s characters\, themes\, writing\, and bigger ideas.
 \n\nYou definitely don’t need to be a literary expert. Whether you read 
 constantly or you’re trying to get back into it\, this is a relaxed plac
 e to discover new books\, hear different perspectives\, and meet some grea
 t people along the way.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315656887/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260712T184543Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260712T184543Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
