DESCRIPTION:Residence Life & Housing will be hosting a Speed Friending even
 t designed to foster student connections and support our ongoing room cons
 olidation process.\n\nDuring the event\, students will wear labeled name t
 ags indicating what they are looking for (e.g.\, friends\, potential roomm
 ates\, study partners). We will facilitate timed\, 3-minute rounds to give
  participants the opportunity to break the ice and meet multiple peers. Fo
 llowing the structured rounds\, we will host a bracelet-making activity to
  provide a relaxed\, welcoming environment where students can continue bui
 lding on the connections they made.
GEO:35.610912;-82.442142
LOCATION:Canon Lounge in Gladfelter Student Center
SUMMARY:Speed Friending 
