BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/arbor-evenings-35/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260909T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260909T203000
DTSTAMP:20260805T192339Z
CREATED:20260710T074601Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T192339Z
UID:1778780019680-1788975000-1788985800@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Arbor Evenings
DESCRIPTION:Arbor Evenings 2026\nJune 10 – September 17\, 2026\nBaker Event Lawn\nSip and stroll through the gardens in the glow of the golden hour\, all while listening to live music from a variety of local and regional artists! Arbor Evenings runs Wednesdays and Thursdays June 10 through September 17\, 2026 from 5:30 to 8:30 p.m. \n  \n  \n**Please note: Outside alcohol is prohibited on the campus of The North Carolina Arboretum.** \nThere is no additional cost to attend ArborEvenings beyond our standard parking fee. As always\, Arboretum Society members and their accompanying guests can enter for FREE (guests must be in member vehicles to receive free entry). Proceeds from Arbor Evenings help support The North Carolina Arboretum Society and further advance the Arboretum’s mission. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5:30 – 8:30: Angela Easterling & Brandon Turner (Not quite country & not quite folk! Angela\, a unique and engaging songwriter\, brings rootsy\, refreshing\, and homespun tunes with her duo partner\, Brandon)\nEnjoy dinner from a rotating selecting of food trucks!\n\nScheduled performances are subject to change.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nView upcoming dates here. \nSupport for this event series is generously provided by:
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/arbor-evenings-35/
LOCATION:Baker Event Lawn
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Stephan-Pruitt-Photography-North-Carolina-Arboretum-Arbor-Evenings-September-Asheville-81.jpg
END:VEVENT
