X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315883238/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_315883238@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041403Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T210000
SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Jaffe and Friends
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, September 11th\nEvenin
 g Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\
 nLIVE Music w/ Jaffe and Friends \\| Support Facilitator: Kris Hostikka\n\
 nIntention: Grounding in Rhythm\nWe move through a journey of sound—Afri
 can and Latin rhythms woven into jamtronica\, alongside flowing electronic
  music.\nA drum-centric passage will bring the djembe and percussion forwa
 rd\, inviting us deeper into the heartbeat of the rhythm.\nFrom grounded p
 ulse to expansive grooves\, we open to free expression\, joyful release\, 
 and deep connection.\n\nAbout the Musicians:\nJaffe is a Music producer an
 d multi-instrumentalist blending electronic instruments\, guitar\, and dje
 mbe. He has Studied West African drumming and incorporates live looping in
 to layered immersive soundscapes spanning many genres. Performing for danc
 es across South Florida and Asheville\, he creates music that invites free
  movement and deep connection.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the
  dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and a
 ny that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe 
 and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $25-50 or name your price.\nN
 o one turned away for lack of funds!\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\n[ht
 tps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/live-music-20260911/](https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/live-music-20260911/)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\
 n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer
  at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ
 0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAET
 f8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nI
 MPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening
  circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollect
 ive agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYn
 JpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFI
 NP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootR
 UE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world th
 at moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within
  a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and h
 ealthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for person
 al and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization
 .\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance f
 loor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315883238/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T013045Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T013045Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville 20S 40S Social Group": "https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events/316300396/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_20s_40s_social_group
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_316300396@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041357Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T220000
SUMMARY:Learn to Swing Dance + 2 Hours of Social Dancing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nLet's go to Asheville Swing Ni
 ght on Friday Sept 11th for an evening of swing dancing\, great music\, an
 d a fun beginner-friendly lesson. 💃🕺\n\nThe instructors (Jared & Mar
 guerite) will kick things off at 7PM with the beginner fundamentals so eve
 ryone can learn the basic footwork and get comfortable with swing dancing.
  🎶\n\nNo partner needed. During both the lesson and social dance\, most
  people rotate partners\, making it a fun way to meet people and get comfo
 rtable in the space.\n\n(Most people come alone\, by the way.)\n\n**What d
 ance are we learning?**\nIntro Lindy Hop and East Coast Swing.\n\n**How ma
 ny people will be there?**\nThroughout the night there are usually 50–70
  people who attend. The lesson and dance is open to the public\, not just 
 this Meetup group.\n\n**What should I wear?**\nWear shoes that are comfort
 able to dance in. Heels are not recommended. Leather-soled shoes or comfor
 table sneakers are best. Dressing up is optional — people wear everythin
 g from casual to vintage-inspired outfits.\n\n**Does the Meetup group sit 
 together all evening?**\nOnce the lesson starts\, the Meetup group dispers
 es to take the lesson with everyone else. The lesson is immediately follow
 ed by a social dance. In our experience\, some of the Meetup attendees con
 tinue to sit together\, chat\, and listen to the music. Others (including 
 the hosts) will be gone dancing and mingling around the room.\n\n**Logisti
 cs**\n📍 Location: Haw Creek Commons\nParking is onsite\, or at Haw Cree
 k Elementary if the parking lot is full. Just walk across the field to the
  venue.\n\n🕖 7PM sharp — Beginner swing dance lesson\n(Please arrive 
 on time\, as the lesson builds progressively and is harder to join late if
  you're brand new.)\n\n💃🕺 8-10:00PM — Social dance with DJ\n\n💵
  $10 admission includes both the lesson and dance\nPay at the door (cash o
 r Venmo)\n\n🚪 Doors open at 6:45 PM\n\n👥 Ages 12+\n\n**More Info:**\
 nFacebook Event:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/1470766331735914\n\nWebs
 ite: [https://ashevilleswingnight.com/](https://ashevilleswingnight.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /316300396/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260827T180611Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T180611Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
