X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Asheville.com": "https://www.asheville.com/event/mapping-home/2026-09-15/", "Hendersonville.com": "https://www.hendersonville.com/event/mapping-home/2026-09-15/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Asheville.com": "https://www.asheville.com/event/mapping-home/2026-09-15/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:asheville_com
SUMMARY:Mapping Home
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260915T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260915T160000
UID:bae2096d513a0dd60e14ab2a7e0ec742@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Cost: Free | Recurring daily until Saturday\, October 3\, 2026
 . Elizabeth Holden Gallery’s exhibition Mapping Home will be on view at 
 Warren Wilson College from August 27th to October 3rd\, 2026. The notion o
 f home takes on a whole new meaning after a climate disaster like Hurrican
 e Helene. Home is a place of reflection\, home is near and far\, home prov
