DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T113000
DTSTAMP:20260827T150857Z
CREATED:20260610T164807Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T150857Z
UID:10006757-1789551000-1789558200@www.ashevilleart.org
SUMMARY:The Art of Yoga | Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Museum every third Wednesday for a harmonious blend of artistic inspiration and mindful movement! Our Wednesday sessions are from 9:30–10:30am.  Experience how close looking at art and practicing yoga in the beautiful spaces of the Museum can foster relaxation and connection. \nEach yoga session includes a guided mindful looking session in one of the Museum’s current exhibitions. \nAll levels are welcome. Please bring your own yoga mat. No mat\, no problem\, the Museum has some extra mats to lend. Loose-fitting clothing is recommended\, ensuring ease of movement as you flow through your practice. \nPurchase Tickets \nPlease enter through the Staff Entrance
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/the-art-of-yoga-wednesdays/2026-09-16/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Wellness
