 -27/996e9209-220a-4ac4-9ee0-430a2939ba7a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:**Death Lens** fuse the urgency of punk with the grit and melo
 dy of Southern Calif rock\, turning everyday struggle into cathartic\, com
 munal release. Raised in working class neighborhoods and proud of their ro
 ots\, the band channels lived experience into songs that balance sharp soc
 ial awareness with a sense of hope\, crafting choruses meant to be shouted
  back from the pit. With every show and every song\, Death Lens continue t
 o build a world where outsiders belong and resilience feels electric. **P
LOCATION:Static Age Records\, 110 North Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, Nor
 th Carolina 28801\, United States
URL:https://link.dice.fm/l2363318ae51
