 -18/5715166f-88f7-4a2c-b738-7ab58177a190.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Eulogy Presents: Saves the Day w/ Kerosene Heights Fri\, Septe
 mber 18th\, 2026 Eulogy - 10 Buxton Ave. Asheville\, NC 28801 Doors 8PM ||
  Show 9PM **Saves the Day** Saves The Day is a band from Princeton\, New J
 ersey\, and yet so much more\, too. Because Saves The Day is also a byword
  for the entire emo sound\, on which the band’s remarkable influence has
  few equals. Fronted today\, just as they were when they first exploded as
  starry eyed teenagers\, by the inimitable Chris Conley\, the songs born o
