X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/316168602/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_316168602@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041403Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Facilitator DJ SeigeA (CJ O'Reilly)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, September 20th\n1st Da
 nce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Danc
 e Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilit
 ator DJ SeigeA (CJ O'Reilly)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About CJ O'Reilly\n\n
 CJ O'Reilly has been creating ecstatic dance waves for the Asheville commu
 nity since 2014. Their eclectic mix of musical styles beckons dancers into
  new patterns of movement and expression through diverse time signatures a
 nd instrumentation\, and a wide range of musical and emotive qualities. CJ
 's waves explore high peaks\, beautiful vistas\, juicy lowlands and the pr
 ofound reflective stillness of tranquil water. CJ's dance waves are pre-pr
 oduced and refined through the body and ears of a dancer and audiophile.\n
 Find more of DJ SeigeA's dance waves at [https://dj.seigea.com](https://dj
 .seigea.com)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at War
 m up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late wi
 ll be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container
 . \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned aw
 ay for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe n
 eed volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[
 https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovem
 entcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFl
