BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Devilsfootbrew": "https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/free-live-music-jvnk-drawer/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:devilsfootbrew
X-SOURCE:The Mule at Devils Foot
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T200000
DTSTAMP:20260905T001440
CREATED:20260814T221631Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260814T221631Z
UID:10001804-1790272800-1790280000@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:Free Live Music: Jvnk Drawer
DESCRIPTION:Some bands write songs. Jvnk Drawer excavates them\n— pulling from a thirty-year vein of half-forgotten gems\, salvaged riffs\, and songs that were simply waiting for the right band to play them. The result is alternative rock with real mileage on it: melodies sharp enough to catch you off guard\, lyrics honest enough to stick. \nAt its center is Gavin Conner\, a songwriter whose Asheville roots run back to 2007\, when he arrived in town to join local favorites\, If You Wannas. What followed was a long apprenticeship in the local scene — a solo run\, countless stages\, and a songbook that quietly grew into something few writers ever amass. By 2017\, that songbook needed a band worthy of it\, and Jvnk Drawer was born\, with drummer Chris Peterson and bassist Erik Avots rounding out the lineup and giving the songs a pulse. \nLike most everything else\, the band’s momentum stalled when the pandemic hit\, and the members drifted toward other projects to wait it out. But the songs didn’t go anywhere\, and neither did the itch to play them. Jvnk Drawer has since reformed sharper and more locked-in than ever\, splicing decades of Gavin’s back catalog together with newly written material that sounds like it’s always belonged there. \nThe name says it best: a jumble of pieces that when put together\, somehow make perfect sense. Equal parts catchy and cutting\, Jvnk Drawer is proof that the best songs are worth digging for. \nGavin Conner — Vocals\, Guitar Chris Peterson — Drums Erik Avots — Bass \n  \nFree Show 6-8p. All Ages.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/free-live-music-jvnk-drawer/
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/8.5x11.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=d6cb359e0917cc1f4c74826c63212103
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville Runners": "https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/315933570/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_runners
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_315933570@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041404Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/315933570/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260801T141830Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260801T141830Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
