X-SOURCE-ID:dice_static_age
SUMMARY:Powerplant w/ Cheeks & Pollute
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T000000
UID:40f6afdebbe9defa7dd390e7610bfd59@dice.fm
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-06
 -16/95e049b3-c9aa-49bc-96a4-f138210ecdfb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Powerplant\, the solitary project of Ukraine-born\, London-bas
 ed Theo Zhykharyev\, is distinguished by its giddy bass\, sizzling synth l
 ines and melancholic vocal hooks. Both sonically and thematically the Powe
 rplant project is ever evolving - after the lo-fi synth-punk of 2019’s b
