UID:9942344b2e8e53b8535bac120749c4b3@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Beyond Fit: Owning Your Place at the Table Early-career profes
 sionals often feel the effects of "fit " culture acutely - wondering wheth
 er they're being judged on their capability or on how well they match an u
 nspoken mold and quietly second-guessing whether they belong in the room. 
 This session names that dynamic directly\, gives young professionals langu
