ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-09
 -03/378eb102-7da2-4d7b-84ab-9d7b40f6e884.jpg
DESCRIPTION:**Telehealth** is a Seattle synth punk conglomerate formed by 
 Alexander Attitude and Kendra Cox\, alongside Ian McCutcheon\, and John O
 ’Connort. Emerging from the Pacific Northwest\, the group treats modern 
 culture like a marketplace\, interrogating burnout\, tech optimism\, brand
 ing\, and the performance of "progress" through sharp hooks and danceable 
 tension. Blending art rock\, new wave\, and nervy post-punk with industria
 l-tinged synths\, Telehealth channels the friction between underground mus
 ic and 
