 , 2026 Eulogy - 10 Buxton Ave. Asheville\, NC 28801 Doors 7PM || Show 8PM 
 **The Stews** Forming at Auburn University\, The Stews ultimately decided 
 to leave school to meet the massive demand for their live shows and raw\, 
 high-energy rock music. The now-Atlanta-based band since have graduated fr
 om the ‘college band’ label\, selling out venues nationwide from NYC
 ’s Bowery Ballroom\, to DC’s 9:30 Club and Wilmington's Greenfield Lak
 e Amphithea
LOCATION:Eulogy\, 10 Buxton Avenue\, Asheville\, North Carolina 28801\, Un
 ited States
